        "id": 1348429
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-01-11T13:32:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The targeted hardware is not intended to run newer kernels, plus the affected subsystems have diverted enough from 5.10 to result in basically two distinctive solution for the erratum, with the upstream one being basically a dead, untested code.",
      "parentUuid": "44b1f021_c97bbba2",
      "revId": "c8d88b854f747ad95648b3b9dc4755528c0062c1",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
